{"name":"Quail Valley","hex":"#ab9673","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"quail","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To waste away; to fade, to wither. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","To daunt or frighten (someone)."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various small game birds of the genera Coturnix, Anurophasis or Perdicula in the Old World family Phasianidae or of the New World family Odontophoridae.","The meat from this bird eaten as food."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/quail"},{"term":"valley","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An elongated depression cast between hills or mountains, often with a river flowing through it.","An area which drains itself into a river."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To form the shape of a valley."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/valley"}],"entries":[{"title":"Quail Valley, Menifee, California","blocks":[{"text":"Quail Valley is a former census-designated place (CDP) in Riverside County, California, United States. On October 1, 2008, the community along with the neighboring communities of Sun City and Menifee incorporated as the City of Menifee."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quail_Valley%2C_Menifee%2C_California","wikidata":"Q2547023"},{"title":"Quail Valley (Missouri City, Texas)","blocks":[{"text":"Quail Valley is a neighborhood dating from 1969 of Missouri City, in Fort Bend County, Texas, United States."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Quail_Valley_Golf_Course.jpg/330px-Quail_Valley_Golf_Course.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quail_Valley_(Missouri_City%2C_Texas)","wikidata":"Q7268505"},{"title":"Quail","blocks":[{"text":"Quail is a collective name for several genera of mid-sized birds generally placed in the order Galliformes. The collective noun for a group of quail is a flock, covey, or bevy."}],"image